    <title>Physical Exam</title>
    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 1980-10-06; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Alert, direct, and energetic; weight 56.4 kg, BMI 19.5</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Pupils equal and reactive; near vision 20/30 with reading glasses</td></tr><tr><td>Ears</td><td>Canals clear; whispered-voice test passed in both ears</td></tr><tr><td>Neck</td><td>No thyroid enlargement or nodes; no carotid bruits</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Regular rhythm at 64 per minute; no murmur; no edema. Blood pressure 126/74 mmHg seated and 122/72 mmHg after 3 minutes standing</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Clear to auscultation bilaterally; no wheeze</td></tr><tr><td>Abdomen</td><td>Soft and non-tender; no masses</td></tr><tr><td>Breasts</td><td>Not examined; screening mammogram ordered</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Timed Up and Go 9 seconds; rises from a chair without using her arms</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Side-to-side head tremor, unchanged; mild postural tremor of both hands; no rest tremor, bradykinesia, or rigidity; tandem gait normal; Mini-Cog 5 of 5</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Euthymic and engaged; judgment and insight intact</td></tr><tr><td>Skin</td><td>Freckling and sun damage on the face and forearms; no suspicious lesions</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

